flowchart TD
    A[Write or rewrite a package README] --> B[Copy assets/README.template.md]
    B --> C[Resolve the docs target first]

    C --> C1{"Docs site? repo?<br/>marketing site?"}
    C1 -->|None| C2["Build one:<br/>&lt;npm-name&gt;-docs.aoneahsan.com"]
    C1 -->|Found| C3[Probe it — curl status]
    C2 --> C3
    C3 --> C4{200 or 301?}
    C4 -->|No| C5[Do NOT link it.<br/>Fix the source that named it]
    C5 --> C1
    C4 -->|Yes| H[Header block]

    H --> H1["1 logo · 2 h1 · 3 one-line promise<br/>4 badges · 5 link row ≤6"]
    H1 --> H2{"Must-know-before-install<br/>fact exists?"}
    H2 -->|Yes| H3["6 &gt; [!IMPORTANT] callout"]
    H2 -->|No| H4
    H3 --> H4["7 summary 2–4 sentences<br/>8 at-a-glance table<br/>9 table of contents"]

    H4 --> S[Walk the 27 sections IN ORDER]

    S --> S1{"Does this package<br/>need this section?"}
    S1 -->|No| S2[Skip it — never reorder<br/>what remains]
    S1 -->|Yes| S3["Anchor contract:<br/>&lt;a id&gt; + EMOJI from the map<br/>+ [#] permalink"]
    S2 --> S4
    S3 --> S5{"Is this fact already<br/>in another section?"}

    S5 -->|Yes| S6[🔴 Single-home rule —<br/>pick the home, link from<br/>the other]
    S5 -->|No| S7[Write it: brief,<br/>structured, links out<br/>for depth]
    S6 --> S7
    S7 --> S4{More sections?}
    S4 -->|Yes| S1
    S4 -->|No| B2[Ban sweep]

    B2 --> B3["Current State / Verified Package<br/>Architecture / Verification Commands<br/>→ CONTRIBUTING.md or delete"]
    B3 --> B4[No duplicate headings]
    B4 --> B5["No relative link or image —<br/>npm renders off-repo"]
    B5 --> B6[No invented adopters,<br/>no fabricated stats]

    B6 --> V[Verify]
    V --> V1[TOC matches the heading set]
    V1 --> V2[No duplicate anchor id]
    V2 --> V3[Every link returns 200/301]
    V3 --> V4["README agrees with package.json:<br/>description = tagline,<br/>keywords = Keywords line,<br/>version = at-a-glance"]
    V4 --> D([Ready for the publish gate])

    style S6 fill:#ffe0e0,stroke:#c00
    style C5 fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#c90
    style D fill:#e0f0e0,stroke:#0a0
